omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R9dVtSXNVUkQ7kNvwFnZs9M&_nc_oc=AdqyC9nzj-bmSoRIcmT-KTjchvn5u0p3Xms59Bib7Bd-BKVDWnmrYrpYuhB5oc5MgY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAR3Pa1ik-SLsDEFBZAsDafYDpgkcLQDjO-3Qo4WpR44A&oe=6A5E3D34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a-rlCzBibb0Q7kNvwFoid5b&_nc_oc=AdqyfyQgBVfVMCD7cykG9JJHpGfGNWZARkv1arvXhz3B0HFQBGSmQa-SV-Fdfv58mE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCTUv21VrlQ9GlLcus-_EKaVxMpGYceYVISb_WkturX4w&oe=6A5E0656"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XxbNlqcBJWkQ7kNvwGt3L9e&_nc_oc=AdoWaPpAdNjyLv4XaAswUirymqIS09kw30qAwDGH9_RkB1hCoKlTJAgrL_cr3HBkUUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAkUJdSnPHKxf11LuRJGH0wtLcusWBt7am1PCJhG4XBMA&oe=6A5E1B77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://